WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:20.250
Phunziroli likufotokoza dzenje la pakati pa disiki ya mtsempha wa kuona.

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:17.800
Chithunzicho chikuyerekezera mulifupi mwa dzenjelo ndi mulifupi mwa disiki yonse.

00:01:55.600 --> 00:02:15.600
Mabwalo asonyezedwa pafupi ndi ma disiki osiyanasiyana kuti muyerekezere kukula kwake.

00:02:53.400 --> 00:03:13.400
Pa chitsanzo chomaliza pali chiŵerengero cha ziro dontho naini.
